            <ArticleTitle>[Critical review of pain evaluation tools in adult patients suffering with cancer].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-57</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article presents a systematic review of the instruments measuring pain with patients suffering from cancer. A description of each instrument is provided followed by the presentation of the psychometric characteristics. The review is followed by a discussion on the relevancy of these instruments as well as their application in clinics.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
